## hadeshash reference implementation  (affects: src/grain.zig,
## src/mds_security.zig, tools/subspace_trail.py)

`src/grain.zig` ports the reference `generate_parameters_grain.sage`: the 80-bit
Grain LFSR and its seeding (`init_generator`), the round-constant draw
(`generate_constants`) and the Cauchy MDS construction (`create_mds_p`).
`src/mds_security.zig` ports the candidate-acceptance checks from the same
script — `algorithm_1`, `algorithm_2`, `algorithm_3`,
`check_minpoly_condition`, `generate_vectorspace` and `subspace_times_matrix`
(the subspace-trail tests of Grassi-Rechberger-Schofnegger) — and ships literal
transcriptions of them alongside the proved-equivalent fast paths the module
actually runs.

